- Nirvana?

00:36:44.970 --> 00:36:45.803
Skiing nirvana?

00:36:45.803 --> 00:36:46.803
- Foot nirvana.

00:36:49.090 --> 00:36:49.923
- Yes.

00:36:49.923 --> 00:36:51.860
- It was dramatically better?

00:36:51.860 --> 00:36:53.038
- When your foot is,

00:36:53.038 --> 00:36:55.550
the thing that most people don't realize

00:36:55.550 --> 00:36:58.010
