00:37:01.800 --> 00:37:05.880
so that your foot is, any
movement inside the boot

00:37:06.880 --> 00:37:10.130
is being immediately
transferred into leverage.

00:37:10.130 --> 00:37:10.963
You know what I'm saying?

00:37:10.963 --> 00:37:12.110
Because it's a little bit loose,

00:37:12.110 --> 00:37:14.110
you move your leg and then
you hit the side of the boot

00:37:14.110 --> 00:37:15.770
