Oh, there he is.

00:38:06.013 --> 00:38:07.230
Oh, here's the menu.

00:38:07.230 --> 00:38:10.760
It's like that was kind of
the adversity that I faced.

00:38:10.760 --> 00:38:11.680
- Well, I had--

00:38:11.680 --> 00:38:14.020
