like I was wrapping a baby

00:39:38.030 --> 00:39:39.700
in a cloth diaper.

00:39:39.700 --> 00:39:41.420
Like that's what she was doing to me.

00:39:41.420 --> 00:39:42.253
- Yeah.

00:39:42.253 --> 00:39:45.200
- But at certain points, my
entire butt cheek was exposed

00:39:45.200 --> 00:39:50.200
and like my knee was being
pushed up across my body.

00:39:50.257 --> 00:39:52.830
- That's the best part
of the massage though.

00:39:52.830 --> 00:39:56.210
- It hurt really badly
because of this injury I have

00:39:56.210 --> 00:39:59.100
and I don't know if she made
it better because still hurting

00:39:59.100 --> 00:40:02.650
but well, I'll put it to you this way.

00:40:02.650 --> 00:40:05.460
You know how when you're grilling chickens

00:40:05.460 --> 00:40:08.900
and if you like, if you've
only cut the dark meat

00:40:08.900 --> 00:40:11.300
separate from the white meat
so you've got like a thigh

00:40:11.300 --> 00:40:13.260
and a leg that's still together

00:40:13.260 --> 00:40:15.820
and then you wanna know if it's done

00:40:15.820 --> 00:40:18.320
but if you're a little
anxious to get it on the table

